    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550240/extras/19ffd9d29a6fceab6d6327975a01a445.poster.avif?t=1751167126\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550240/extras/19ffd9d29a6fceab6d6327975a01a445.webm?t=1751167126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550240/extras/19ffd9d29a6fceab6d6327975a01a445.mp4?t=1751167126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Finding Pots &amp; Pets, a charming hidden object game set in the magical world of Bunnyland. Immerse yourself in beautifully crafted pixel art environments as you search for adorable animals and exquisite pots. This relaxing adventure offers a perfect blend of nostalgia and modern gameplay, inviting players of all ages to explore and discover at their own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550240/extras/f56ba14663809b748531979e87693f6c.poster.avif?t=1751167126\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550240/extras/f56ba14663809b748531979e87693f6c.webm?t=1751167126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550240/extras/f56ba14663809b748531979e87693f6c.mp4?t=1751167126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 9 intricate levels, each hiding over 200 unique pets and pots, totaling more than 3,000 items to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with a diverse cast of quirky NPCs, each with their own personality and stories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stuck? Use our intuitive hint system to help you along your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose yourself in the stunning pixel art landscapes of Bunnyland, from lush gardens to cozy cottages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a stress-free gaming experience with soothing background music and gentle sound effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself to find special bonus items hidden in each level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your progress and continue your adventure whenever you like.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Challenge Mode for even greater difficulty and replay value.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the enchanting world of Finding Pots &amp; Pets and let the hunt begin! Can you uncover all the secrets Bunnyland has to offer? Start your whimsical journey today and discover the joy of finding the cutest pets and most beautiful pots in this pixelated paradise.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550240/extras/19ffd9d29a6fceab6d6327975a01a445.poster.avif?t=1751167126\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550240/extras/19ffd9d29a6fceab6d6327975a01a445.webm?t=1751167126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550240/extras/19ffd9d29a6fceab6d6327975a01a445.mp4?t=1751167126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Finding Pots &amp; Pets, a charming hidden object game set in the magical world of Bunnyland. Immerse yourself in beautifully crafted pixel art environments as you search for adorable animals and exquisite pots. This relaxing adventure offers a perfect blend of nostalgia and modern gameplay, inviting players of all ages to explore and discover at their own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550240/extras/f56ba14663809b748531979e87693f6c.poster.avif?t=1751167126\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550240/extras/f56ba14663809b748531979e87693f6c.webm?t=1751167126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550240/extras/f56ba14663809b748531979e87693f6c.mp4?t=1751167126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 9 intricate levels, each hiding over 200 unique pets and pots, totaling more than 3,000 items to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with a diverse cast of quirky NPCs, each with their own personality and stories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stuck? Use our intuitive hint system to help you along your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose yourself in the stunning pixel art landscapes of Bunnyland, from lush gardens to cozy cottages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a stress-free gaming experience with soothing background music and gentle sound effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself to find special bonus items hidden in each level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your progress and continue your adventure whenever you like.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Challenge Mode for even greater difficulty and replay value.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the enchanting world of Finding Pots &amp; Pets and let the hunt begin! Can you uncover all the secrets Bunnyland has to offer? Start your whimsical journey today and discover the joy of finding the cutest pets and most beautiful pots in this pixelated paradise.</p>",
    "short_description": "Finding Pots &amp; Pets: A charming hidden object game with a pixelated twist. Explore Bunnyland, discover cute pets and pots, solve puzzles. Enjoy relaxing gameplay, meet quirky NPCs. Classic seek-and-find meets pixel art adventure. For casual gamers and hidden object enthusiasts alike.",
